KAHA KULSOOM NE ROKAR MERA ABBAS GAR HOTA,<br>
 NA YUN BARBAAD HOTA GHAR MERA ABBAS GAR HOTA<br>
<br>
QHALAM HOTE NA GAR SHAANE TOH KYA HOTA KHUDA JAANE,<br>
 ULAT TA SHAAM KA LASHKAR MERA ABBAS GAR HOTA<br>
<br>
MERE BHAYI KI GARDANPAR NA CHAALTA SHUMR KA KHANJAR,<br>
 KAHAN NAIZE PAR HOTA SAR MERA ABBAS GAR HOTA<br>
<br>
NA HOTA FATIMA KA LAAL GHODOON SE KABHI PAMAAL,<br>
 NA PHIRTE HUM KABHI DAR DAR MERA ABBAS GAR HOTA<br>
<br>
BHADAKTE SHOLAY KHAIMON MEIN NA LAGTI AAG KURTON MEIN,<br>
 NA KOI LOOT TA CHADAR MERA ABBAS GAR HOTA,<br>
<br>
NA HOTA TAUQ GARDAN MEIN NA ZANJEERE GARAN TAN MEIN,<br>
 NA HOTA ZULM ABID PAR MERA ABBAS GAR HOTA<br>
<br>
SAKINA KO NA MAUT AATI NA BACHCHI SELIYAN KHATI,<br>
 NA KOI CHEENTA GAUHAR MERA BBAS GAR HOTA<br>
<br>
AJAB AHSAN HAI YE MANZAR MADINE MEIN HAIN EK MEHSHAR,<br>
 KE SAB ROTE HAIN YE SUNKAR MERA ABBAS GAR HOTA..